<title>USA: Knox County, Tenn., Health $84 mln repriced.</title>
<headline>Knox County, Tenn., Health $84 mln repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Robinson-Humphrey Co said it repriced an $84 million Knox County, Tenn., Health Educational and Housing Facilities, hospital revenue refunding and improvement bond issue, Series 1996, for The Baptist Health System of East Tennessee Obligated Group, cutting the yields on some maturities and adjusting some coupons.</p>
<p>THE HEALTH EDUCATIONAL AND HOUSING FACILITIES</p>
<p>RE: $84,560,000*</p>
<p>BOARD OF THE COUNTY OF KNOX (TENNESSEE)</p>
